        "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@\n+name: Feature Request\n+description: Suggest a new feature or improvement\n+labels: [\"enhancement\"]\n+body:\n+  - type: textarea\n+    id: description\n+    attributes:\n+      label: Description\n+      description: What do you want to see added or changed?\n+    validations:\n+      required: true\n+\n+  - type: textarea\n+    id: reason\n+    attributes:\n+      label: Why?\n+      description: Why would this be useful?\n+    validations:\n+      required: true\n+\n+  - type: textarea\n+    id: additional-context\n+    attributes:\n+      label: Additional context\n+      description: Mockups, examples, or anything else relevant.\n\\ No newline at end of file"
